In the solution, the function `geometric_sum` calculates the geometric sum of n-1 using the formula `1 + 2^(n-1) / (1 - 2^(-n))`. This formula is derived from the geometric series sum formula for `n > 0`. The test case `assert geometric_sum(7) == 1.9921875` checks if the function returns the expected value when `n` is 7.

